WEBVTT

00:17:59.956 --> 00:18:01.436
Major opportunities lost?

00:18:01.476 --> 00:18:02.636
Do you have some advice

00:18:02.636 --> 00:18:06.316
on how to avoid being paralyzed
by fear or further regret?"

00:18:07.076 --> 00:18:08.476
DHP: Yeah.

00:18:08.476 --> 00:18:11.196
It’s interesting that Claudia
said “opportunities lost,”

00:18:11.196 --> 00:18:13.396
and let me pick up
on that phrase right here.

00:18:13.436 --> 00:18:15.836
Because one of the things
I saw in my own research,

00:18:15.876 --> 00:18:19.516
because I also did a huge survey
of the American population

00:18:19.556 --> 00:18:22.756
where we surveyed

00:18:22.756 --> 00:18:26.676
a representative sample of 4,489 Americans

00:18:26.716 --> 00:18:29.316
about regret and how it worked.

00:18:29.796 --> 00:18:31.716
But one of the things you see widespread